# a2r project emission (legacy `test/a2r/14_modules/005_multi_file`)

Project-mode emission has NO legacy byte golden (the legacy test asserts
key sets + `mod` declarations only). The five oracle sidecars under
`oracle/` are NEW: generated from the adapter's deterministic materialized
layout (`<case>/project`) via the proposal flow, then independently
reviewed before being accepted (see legacy-map.tsv). Note the Cargo.toml
app name derives from the materialized entry directory name — part of the
input identity (feasibility §4).

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/1"
  id: "trans.project.multi-file"
  tags: ["pilot", "a2r", "project", "multi-artifact"]
  links: ["PLAN-768"]
  source: { file: "a2r/14_modules/005_multi_file/main.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  files: [
    { path: "db.at", file: "a2r/14_modules/005_multi_file/db.at" },
    { path: "api/mod.at", file: "a2r/14_modules/005_multi_file/api/mod.at" },
    { path: "api/handlers.at", file: "a2r/14_modules/005_multi_file/api/handlers.at" }
  ]
  entry: { mode: "module" }
  checks: [
    { id: "emit", adapter: "a2r", action: "emit", tier: "trans-snapshot",
      expect: { completion: "success", artifacts: [
        { path: "main.rs", file: "cases/pilot/oracle/trans.project.multi-file.main.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "db.rs", file: "cases/pilot/oracle/trans.project.multi-file.db.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "api/mod.rs", file: "cases/pilot/oracle/trans.project.multi-file.api-mod.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "api/handlers.rs", file: "cases/pilot/oracle/trans.project.multi-file.api-handlers.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "Cargo.toml", file: "cases/pilot/oracle/trans.project.multi-file.Cargo.toml", compare: "bytes" }
      ] } }
  ]
}
```
